        "type": "text",
        "text": "All references read. This is a **ranking across categories** (pre-aggregated) \u2192 `geom_col`, horizontal for the long island names, sliced to a **top-N** so the biggest are easy to compare. No hero color variable \u2192 single house accent, no legend. Tall figure `(6,7)` is mandatory for the horizontal ranking. Applying learned preference **L1**: `theme_classic()` as the base instead of `theme_minimal`."
